# Tanaris (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 confirmed flagged rares of Tanaris and
# its fixed world containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of
# the Horde core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that
# is not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever), re-verified point-for-point for the
# Horde side; the set is genuinely identical to the Alliance inventory's
# (see docs/tanaris-horde-companions-inventory.md). Signature drops are
# items whose SOLE dropper is the rare, and four of the ten have none -
# they ship as kill goals with notes. Nine rares are a single confirmed
# point each, so those steps are plain single-goto steps (a loop needs at
# least two); Zopilote loops its 38 confirmed points in the east. No tame
# lines ship (the data has no tameability flag and tanaris-horde.guide
# carries no tame corroboration - see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No rare in
# this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any Horde-contracted quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tanaris-horde-rares
title Tanaris (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 38-50
zone Tanaris
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords tanaris, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Greater Firebird — the center

  zone map 1446

  goto 49.39,36.04
  kill 8207 optional
  collect 286569 "Firebird Leggings" optional
  note Level 46 rare at its single confirmed point in the center; its sole drop is the Firebird Leggings. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

